    "detail": {
      "id": 1350212,
      "name": "[Sunna] Tour de Rhythm",
      "desc": "Reduces the number of attacks required to trigger <color=#FFFFFF>Cat's Gaze</color>, and when an enemy is afflicted with <color=#FFFFFF>Cat's Gaze</color>, their <color=#2BAD00>Anomaly Buildup Rate is increased by 20%</color> for 10s. When <color=#FFFFFF>Cat's Gaze</color> hits a target afflicted with <color=#FE437E>Ether Anomaly</color>, <color=#2EB6FF>Electric Attribute Anomaly</color>, <color=#FF5521>Fire Attribute Anomaly</color>, <color=#F0D12B>Physical Attribute Anomaly</color>, <color=#98EFF0>Ice Attribute Anomaly</color> or <color=#A6C5FD>Wind Attribute Anomaly</color>, it also triggers one instance of <color=#FFFFFF>Abloom</color>: applies one additional instance of Attribute Anomaly DMG equal to <color=#FE437E>370%</color>/<color=#2EB6FF>192%</color>/<color=#FF5521>480%</color>/<color=#F0D12B>30%</color>/<color=#98EFF0>48%</color>/<color=#A6C5FD>19%</color> of original Attribute Anomaly DMG.",
